# URL Shortener — Project Rules

## Phase awareness
- Check `AGENTS.md` for current implementation phase.
- Only implement features scoped to the active phase agent prompt.
- Do not add Redis/Kafka/auth until their phase.

## Code style
- TypeScript strict mode; prefer explicit types on public APIs.
- Use Fastify route plugins; keep handlers thin, logic in services.
- All DB access through `src/db/`; no raw SQL in routes.

## API contracts
- Follow `docs/api.md` for request/response shapes and status codes.
- Return JSON errors: `{ "error": "message", "code": "ERROR_CODE" }`.

## Testing
- Add unit tests for utils and services.
- Run `make test` before completing a phase.

## Security
- Never commit `.env`; use `.env.example`.
- Hash IPs before storing; validate URLs (http/https only).
